      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the walls in slowly\"... what does that even mean? i feel like i'm staring at a door that's locked from the outside. i've spent so long trying to protect myself, but now i'm just... stuck. like there's no point in even trying to fix anything because nothing ever changes. it's just a cycle.",
